  "answer_text": "To log in to your account, choose the option below that fits your profile:\n\n* **For Students:** Access your pre-licensing study materials, continuing education, or practice tests on the [PreLicenseTraining Student Account Login](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFlle5i2tXcRlU7rvkKOxkcCkCzQOCwAShXxUPg5tlofP_Qfr1ro622FFwl-bJtxoTnIpEh73XtEbbtd4EosrNZU9Z50DbmoWJHeIaTxNAf2C9vdL8ah4gfIBw=). *(Note: Your username is typically the email address you registered with unless you have changed it.)*\n* **For Mentors & Recruiters:** If you are a company representative, recruiter, or manager tracking student progress and scores, use the [PreLicenseTraining Mentor Portal Login](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEJ1IEIQ3__dBOoD6t2mRjEy773fRQxE0jzfzZ0wQay7uvWfxk5ZYDHXRNd6peQ4eaW2EY7pkuNGeRXQjkDAGeMjpu1Fl8YisJmE4-PzTAyUn3zwa2N1hYJjdjE5NFui0XGyC1B3ZsjMhuISg==).\n* **Forgot Your Password?:** If you need to recover or change your student credentials, you can request a reset link via the [PreLicenseTraining Password Recovery Page](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFyNlXiDmMsrQQASw23v4e9fEVL_DCXM0I87l8503XZePUOOYBzBJ6hUp6pgb8jCVDsCRgGOt7hW8Jc2fcwV7-fvwWadx6jKiShcpm9ywENO-SUgHnlrnsBodoHxykjyHWyY4jXc1rzMg==). \n\nFor other resources, course catalog information, or state-specific exam guidelines, you can visit the main [PreLicenseTraining Homepage](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEKHyg1Oj5s_ewT8jL3_HIVNktnxflprW1RUYKy-2dTgDiFVa-awaPqqYpJYtuMgar5ke15U1bGJMJminL1t23NzEpXLbBIvKUdDq_hUOqiXSMz3SZi).",
